        <!--
          ***** what runs once, and what runs every frame *****

          ParticipatingElements names the single link that writes the spread into the Landmarks
          slot. Naming that link pulls everything it depends on - Cons, the three Landmark.Create
          nodes, the three Read WKT nodes and their IOBoxes - into Create, which runs ONCE.

          Everything not named here lands in Update. That is the whole rule, and an empty Create
          fragment (which is what most patches have) means everything runs every frame.
